Bharata thanks Guha for offering to feast army --- Bharata asks Guha for hard Gaṅgā forest path --- Guha pledges bowmen guides and doubts army intent --- Bharata reassures Rāma is fatherlike brother to fetch --- Guha praises Bharata renouncing effortless kingdom --- Sun sets as Bharata camps army with Guha --- Sleepless Bharata burns sweating like melting Himavān --- Guha consoles sorrow-mountain crushed Bharata about Rāma
